Implement selective Category III actions against North
                                    Viet-Nam. (Category III: Intensified harassment of shipping;
                                    blockade of Haiphong or DRV;
                                    mining in the Gulf of Tonkin or Haiphong approaches; blocking
                                    river entrances or Haiphong channel; bombing of selected targets
                                    in North Viet-Nam.)

